{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Diverse customization:** Customize the glass effect for the Lock Screen, Home Screen, App Library and Folders.\n- **System interface:** Applies a refined frosted glass effect to the 3D menu (Context Menu), Notifications, Switches and the Search bar.\n- **Realistic reflections:** Improved logic for the light reflection (specular) effect, making surfaces look smoother and more natural.\n- **Blocklist management:** Use an intuitive app picker to exclude apps, with no need to manually enter Bundle IDs or process names.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
