{
"markdown": "### Version 0.1.1-2b\n- Reworked all system changes.\n- Improved the specular reflection logic for smoother display.\n- Added an FPS limit option for the clock.\n- Fixed the blur effect on iOS 15.\n- Fixed right-to-left (RTL) layout for sliders and tab bars.\n- Optimized the corner rounding logic of modules in Control Center.\n- Improved the context menu style.\n- Fixed the gap at the bottom of the keyboard.\n- Switched to a picker-based app list for exclusions (no need to enter Bundle IDs manually).\n- Added languages: Hebrew, Simplified Chinese and Turkish.",
